bin/
dist/

# `go build ./cmd/x` with no -o writes ./x, in the repository root. That is
# where a 13 MB mapping-audit binary was committed from, past rules that
# covered only the directories a build can be told to use. One line per
# command, kept in step by internal/repoguard.
/mapping-audit
/server
.env
*.log
coverage.out

# Editor and OS noise. Listed once here rather than in each contributor's
# global config, so a stray file cannot reach a review.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
